Package: asgard-pim
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Section: metapackages
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends},
 asgard-gnome-desktop,
 evolution,
 evolution-plugins
Description: @DISTRIBUTION@ personal information management
 Adds the Evolution mail / calendar / address-book client and its
 plugin set on top of the @DISTRIBUTION@ desktop's existing
 gnome-calendar + gnome-contacts + gnome-clocks PIM apps.
 Evolution adds the missing piece: a full IMAP/SMTP/Exchange mail
 client integrated with the GNOME PIM data services
 (evolution-data-server, already pulled in by gnome-core).
 .
 Selecting this metapackage automatically pulls asgard-gnome-desktop
 so a single `apt install asgard-pim` brings up the full PIM stack
 without separate steps.
